{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Luck &amp; Loot</strong></i> is a fast-paced <strong>dice-builder roguelike</strong> where strategy and chaos collide. Forge <strong>custom dice</strong>, harness <strong>wild loot synergies</strong>, and dive into the <strong>cursed realms </strong>of Eldralith; each run a new roll of fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart brutal foes in<strong> turn-based combat</strong>, embrace high-risk modifiers, and uncover dark secrets in a world trapped in cycle. <strong>Victory changes you.</strong> <strong>So does failure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/GIFS-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750457027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dialogue hits as hard as the dice in this pixel-powered showdown.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nostalgic Roguelike With A Dice Building Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of three heroes, each haunted, each hunting meaning. <strong>Customize your dice with powerful, swappable faces</strong> as you forge the perfect build through each high-stakes run. Every choice counts. <strong>Every roll is a risk</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/DiceBuilding-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750457027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Every face is a choice\u2014build your dice, shape your fate.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Dice Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your strategy with <strong>interchangeable, upgradeable dice faces</strong> that define your power\u2014and your fate. <strong>Sacrifice weaker sides to unlock potent traits</strong>, and <strong>adapt your build on the fly</strong> as the dangers of Eldralith deepen. But choose carefully: <strong>each die holds only so much power</strong>, and every decision edges you closer to mastery\u2026 <strong>or ruin</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/LL-ColorPalettesGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750457027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose your curse in color\u2014each palette a new shade of doom.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pixel Peril &amp; Chiptune Charm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into a  <strong>dark fantasy where every pixel drips with dread </strong>and<strong> every chiptune echoes with myth</strong>. <i><strong>Luck &amp; Loot</strong></i> blends <strong>retro style</strong> with <strong>eldritch horror</strong>, inviting you to <strong>brave haunted forests, corrupted keeps, and cursed melodies</strong> alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you break the cycle,\u00a0<strong>or become one more echo in the void?</strong> The dice are cast. <strong>The fate is yours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Heroes with their own unique sets of dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Ever customizable dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Unique dungeons, each dominated by a formidable foe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Powerful dice upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16+ Difficulty modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">36+ Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Unique relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Creature types and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ Interchangeable and upgradeable dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endlessly Replayable</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208110?t=1750457027","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750457027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/287fc76628a4bbbaa25b95a857e704bca49ecf88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750457027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/287fc76628a4bbbaa25b95a857e704bca49ecf88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750457027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3517800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Luck &amp; Loot</strong></i> is a fast-paced <strong>dice-builder roguelike</strong> where strategy and chaos collide. Forge <strong>custom dice</strong>, harness <strong>wild loot synergies</strong>, and dive into the <strong>cursed realms </strong>of Eldralith; each run a new roll of fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart brutal foes in<strong> turn-based combat</strong>, embrace high-risk modifiers, and uncover dark secrets in a world trapped in cycle. <strong>Victory changes you.</strong> <strong>So does failure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/GIFS-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750457027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dialogue hits as hard as the dice in this pixel-powered showdown.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nostalgic Roguelike With A Dice Building Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of three heroes, each haunted, each hunting meaning. <strong>Customize your dice with powerful, swappable faces</strong> as you forge the perfect build through each high-stakes run. Every choice counts. <strong>Every roll is a risk</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/DiceBuilding-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750457027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Every face is a choice\u2014build your dice, shape your fate.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Dice Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your strategy with <strong>interchangeable, upgradeable dice faces</strong> that define your power\u2014and your fate. <strong>Sacrifice weaker sides to unlock potent traits</strong>, and <strong>adapt your build on the fly</strong> as the dangers of Eldralith deepen. But choose carefully: <strong>each die holds only so much power</strong>, and every decision edges you closer to mastery\u2026 <strong>or ruin</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/LL-ColorPalettesGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750457027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose your curse in color\u2014each palette a new shade of doom.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pixel Peril &amp; Chiptune Charm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into a  <strong>dark fantasy where every pixel drips with dread </strong>and<strong> every chiptune echoes with myth</strong>. <i><strong>Luck &amp; Loot</strong></i> blends <strong>retro style</strong> with <strong>eldritch horror</strong>, inviting you to <strong>brave haunted forests, corrupted keeps, and cursed melodies</strong> alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you break the cycle,\u00a0<strong>or become one more echo in the void?</strong> The dice are cast. <strong>The fate is yours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Heroes with their own unique sets of dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Ever customizable dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Unique dungeons, each dominated by a formidable foe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Powerful dice upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16+ Difficulty modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">36+ Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Unique relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Creature types and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ Interchangeable and upgradeable dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endlessly Replayable</p></li></ul>","developers":["SMARTcreative"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/header.jpg?t=1750457027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143703,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143703/movie480.mp4?t=1749067737","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143703/movie_max.mp4?t=1749067737"},"name":"Luck & Loot - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143703/de7edc6dcb220f339e2c9d520edd751daf88e6da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749067737","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143703/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749067737","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143703/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749067737"}}],"name":"Luck & Loot","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versio